# Controls without auto-run (config auto_run = false, the default): from a fresh save into
# Lost Prologue, then Sonic should stand still with the stick centred, run while it is
# pushed, stop when it is released, and run straight while B is held. Compare the
# distance column between the logged phases.
autorun off
include boot_stage1.tas
watch dist f32 9102cd50
wait 4
log idle
wait 3
shot nar_idle
log stick
hold 3 LX=0.3
shot nar_stick
log released
wait 3
shot nar_released
log b_held
hold 3 B
shot nar_b
log end
wait 1
quit
